{:event/actor "seb" :event/at #inst "2026-10-25T22:21:22.039Z" :event/body {:fact/path [:summary] :fact/value "tik rollout minted child and parent tickets with random-uuid and a wall-clock :at, so two backends running the same rollout concurrently each created a child per new repo; the union kept both, and the parent link.<repo> facts disagreed and derived :conflicted. ADR 0021 requires a self-minted event to be a pure function of its intent. Fix: ticket ids derive from (role, subject, process hash, actor, base instant); --period/--at pin the base; writes onto an existing log claim just after the latest event they observed; the backend refuses a scheduled rollout without :period."} :event/parents #{"sha256-5473443cf3b9c372a457ac667a157b48a5b8e865227d78c0b4ced9e671c8b30f"} :event/ticket #uuid "24df69a7-4069-4dfe-a997-4672aff7145e" :event/type :fact/assert}